OL,3,AHealey acknowledges high government
OL,4,Aborrowing costs but won't be drawn on
OL,5,Atax changes in Budget
OL,6,
OL,7,FDuring the speech, Healey announces
OL,8,Fplans to allocate #150m to fast-growing
OL,9,Ffirms in northern England and to create
OL,10,Fthe "northern 500", bringing together
OL,11,F"ambitious mid-sized businesses" in a
OL,12,Fgroup led by mayors
OL,14,FHe also acknowledges that government
OL,15,Fborrowing costs are at "historic
OL,16,Fhighs", blaming "high borrowing and low
OL,17,Fgrowth" which he says has allowed
OL,18,Fnational debt to rise to almost 100% of
OL,19,FGDP
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
